{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09313","headline":"登乐游庙作 · 韦应物","name":"登乐游庙作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高原出东城，郁郁见咸阳。\n上有千载事，乃自汉宣皇。\n颓壖久凌迟，陈迹翳丘荒。\n春草虽复绿，惊风但飘扬。\n周览京城内，双阙起中央。\n微钟何处来，暮色忽苍苍。\n歌吹喧万井，车马塞康庄。\n昔人岂不尔，百世同一伤。\n归当守冲漠，迹寓心自忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09313.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09313","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}